{
  "body" : "You are designing a painterly fantasy illustration set on a lively street.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Scene: {{scene}}\n- Setting: {{setting}}\n- Characters: {{characters}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: Painterly digital illustration with soft, expressive brushstrokes\n- Composition: Balanced framing with a focus on character interaction; layered depth with foreground, middle ground, and background elements\n- Lens / camera: Medium focal length with a natural perspective; no extreme lens distortions\n- Lighting: Warm, soft sunlight with subtle shadows; directional light from the upper left creating a gentle rim light effect on characters\n- Color palette and grading: Earthy tones with pops of warm reds and soft whites; moderately saturated with a cohesive, natural feel\n- Texture / surface: Visible brush strokes with a hand-painted look; smooth gradients in lighting transitions\n- Post-processing: Subtle glow and soft edges around light sources; minor vignette to focus attention on the subject\n- Mood: Whimsical, warm, and slightly mysterious\n- References: Studio Ghibli's painterly style, classical fantasy illustrations, and the works of Pascal Campion\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 3:2 landscape (~1536×1024) suitable for hero illustration placement\n- Maintain a clear focus on character interactions while integrating the setting seamlessly\n- Use light and shadow to emphasize depth and direct the viewer's gaze\n\nAVOID\n- Overly busy compositions that detract from character focus\n- Harsh or artificial lighting\n- Overly saturated or clashing color schemes\n- Flat, textureless surfaces\n- Excessive post-processing effects that obscure the painterly style\n- Unrealistic proportions or anatomy\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nScene: {{scene}}\nSetting: {{setting}}\nCharacters: {{characters}}\nExtra notes: {{extra}}",
